      "content": "thanks. we're doing that now. the weird thing is the unit was showing perfect temps all morning, and then it just spiked out of nowhere without any obvious mechanical damage or warning signs. almost like something just interfered with the sensor. have you seen this happen before where machines just fail for no reason like that?",
