      "content": "it's not just the sensor though. the cooling fans actually stopped spinning for a few minutes too and then just started back up. it feels really erratic, like it's being messed with. is there any way this is caused by something more than just a simple power glitch? like something physically interfering with the mechanism on a micro level?",
